OL,3,GNEWSAFake modelling agent jailed for
OL,4,Arape and break-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed after pressuring
OL,7,Fa woman into a building then raping
OL,8,Fher, before breaking into another
OL,9,Fwoman's house and sexually assaulting
OL,10,Fher.
OL,12,FMohammad Raza, 32, who police said was
OL,13,Fa Pakistani national, received an
OL,14,F18-year prison sentence at Lewes Crown
OL,15,FCourt, sitting in Brighton, on Tuesday.
OL,17,FHe had been convicted of rape and
OL,18,Fassault by penetration, then of
OL,19,Fburglary, sexual assault and
OL,20,Ftrespassing to commit a sexual offence
OL,21,Fat a subsequent trial.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
